# Golden balanced-cut identities

This import-only gate exposes the four symbolic order-six identities used by
the optional formal companion to the Golden quantum-statistics manuscript.
They describe the square of a signed triangle block, the determinant of its
cross Gram matrix, the associated trace contraction, and the resulting
fourth-word trace.

The imported proofs are kernel-checked over an arbitrary commutative ring.
They do not formalize the manuscript's classification, design, decoding,
tomography, optical-compilation, or experimental statements.
